    "title": "PlayMetrics",
    "description": "Transform your business with PlayMetrics, the single source of truth for everyone in your club. One service. One log-in. Everything you need.\r\n\r\nTrusted by the most forward-thinking youth sports clubs, PlayMetrics empowers directors, coaches, admins, and player families to become shockingly efficient with unified financial, operational, coaching, and communication tools. Modernize your operations in ways that weren\u2019t possible before. No more wrestling with messy spreadsheets, impossible-to-find data, and unreliable games of telephone. Always know where everything is, what everyone is working on, and what to do next. Remove uncertainty from your business forever. \r\n\r\nThe PlayMetrics Club Operating System includes:\r\n\r\nPlayer registration and payment processing\r\nClub-wide communications with automated alerts\r\nCoach and player profiles with complete history\r\nCustom form builder, form tracking, and player evaluations\r\nField scheduling and management\r\nTeam assignments and roster updates\r\nCurriculum builder and season periodization\r\nIn-house recreational league support\r\nPractice planning, drills library, and drill illustrator\r\nUser dashboards summarizing crucial data\r\nCloud storage and file sharing\r\nWebsite builder and customization\r\nReal-time attendance tracking\r\nHealth questionnaires\r\nGame schedules and scores\r\n\r\nLearn more at www.playmetrics.com",
